{
  "_source": "griting-opux",
  "_twist": "griting-opux uses Helvetica Neue (non-web) + Inter. Twist: replace Helvetica Neue display with Cormorant Garamond — a Google Fonts serif that carries archival, botanical-press authority at display scale — while retaining Inter for all body and UI text. Cormorant is confirmed on Google Fonts. No woff2 in CSS.",
